{"id":"54517e5af9b2ee4a","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra.md","title":"df-well-founded-monotone-algebra","display":"df-well-founded-monotone-algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra","aliases":["56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra"],"display":"df-well-founded-monotone-algebra","depends_on":["[[56-df-structure]]","[[56-df-reduction-order]]","[[56-df-well-founded]]"],"source_section":"6.2.1","source_pages":"183","source_ocr_blocks":[204],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-well-founded-monotone-algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c18125c091d1dde\" href=\"?note=2c18125c091d1dde\" title=\"56-df-well-founded\">56-df-well-founded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"183"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>204</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(A\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\">\\(I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\\)</span> 为具有指定元数的全运算族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq A^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>。以下两个性质谓词均在这一合格代数参数域内定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,Q)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(A,Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(A,Q)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2c18125c091d1dde\" href=\"?note=2c18125c091d1dde\" title=\"56-df-well-founded\">56-df-well-founded</a>，沿左端到右端的下降方向解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\\iff{}&amp;\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)\\land\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\;\\forall i\\in[\\mathrm{ar}(f)]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(a_iQb_i\\land\\forall j\\in[\\mathrm{ar}(f)]\\setminus\\{i\\}\\;a_j=b_j\n\\Rightarrow I(f)(\\vec a)\\;Q\\;I(f)(\\vec b)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(A,Q).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\\iff{}&amp;\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)\\land\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(A,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}\\;\\forall i\\in[\\mathrm{ar}(f)]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(a_iQb_i\\land\\forall j\\in[\\mathrm{ar}(f)]\\setminus\\{i\\}\\;a_j=b_j\n\\Rightarrow I(f)(\\vec a)\\;Q\\;I(f)(\\vec b)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(A,Q).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 6.2.1。严格单调性对每个允许改写的参数都必须成立；仅要求函数值整体增长，或忽略某个参数，不能推出上下文中的下降。零元函数没有参数，单调条件为空；非空载体仍是代数的必要条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.1，印刷页 183。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"2c18125c091d1dde","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$A\\ne\\varnothing$ 为